{"doc_id": "CrudeOilNews__f7d692ecdbbbfd5c01e68abfb6b19eb6c3c65971", "text": "Investors were also jittery following reports that Russia 's February oil output was unchanged from January at 11.1 million barrels per day -LRB- bdp -RRB- , with cuts remaining at 100,000 , which is well below the production cuts pledged by Russia in a deal with OPEC last November .", "language": "en", "source_dataset": "CrudeOilNews", "category": null, "global_split": "test", "relations": [], "events": [{"event_type": "CAUSE-MOVEMENT-DOWN-LOSS", "trigger": {"text": "cuts", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "FINAL_VALUE", "text": "100,000"}]}, {"event_type": "CAUSE-MOVEMENT-DOWN-LOSS", "trigger": {"text": "cuts", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "production"}, {"role": "SUPPLIER_CONSUMER", "text": "Russia"}, {"role": "REFERENCE_POINT_TIME", "text": "last November"}]}, {"event_type": "MOVEMENT-FLAT", "trigger": {"text": "unchanged", "pos": ""}, "arguments": [{"role": "SUPPLIER_CONSUMER", "text": "Russia"}, {"role": "TYPE", "text": "February"}, {"role": "ITEM", "text": "oil"}, {"role": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "output"}, {"role": "INITIAL_REFERENCE_POINT", "text": "January"}, {"role": "FINAL_VALUE", "text": "11.1 million barrels per day -LRB- bdp"}]}]}
